   "x": 40,
   "y": 930,
   "width": 1180,
   "height": 52,
   "text": "Every character any layer flags stays redacted; where spans overlap, the most harmful type wins (ties: format > spoken > context\n> dialogue > NER > propagation). The spoken and dialogue layers are what separate transcript redaction from document redaction:\non real Whisper output the spoken layer adds 3.9 points of recall; Presidio alone finds 46.5% (E4).",
